/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:990:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.li1: Ships via Japan Post Yu-Pack service.
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:991:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.li2: "Depending on the region, delivery can arrive as early as the next morning, making it ideal if you're in a hurry."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:992:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.li3: Date and time specification is also available. Please use Yu-Pack if you wish to specify a delivery date or time.
