/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:994:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note2: "※In the event of a postal accident, compensation is generally limited to actual damages up to ¥500,000."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:995:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note3: "※If a package is not received and returned after the holding period, an additional shipping fee may be charged."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:996:front.shopping.delivery_modal.yupack.note4: "※To request post office hold delivery, please enter the post office name and address in the notes field."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:997:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.title: "●Combined Shipping"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:998:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.li1: "By selecting [Combined Shipping] as your shipping method, you can combine multiple orders into a single shipment."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:999:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.li2: "Please enter the Order ID of the order you wish to combine in the notes field and select [Combined Shipping] as your shipping method."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1000:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.li3: We will ship your combined orders together.
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1001:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note1: "※Combined shipping is not available if any of the orders to be combined use Credit Card, Cash on Delivery, or Convenience Store Payment."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1002:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note2: "※The maximum number of orders that can be combined, including the base order, is 3."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1003:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note3: "※If you request combined shipping for a 4th or more order, we will combine up to the 3rd order, and combined shipping for the 4th order onwards will not be available."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1004:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note4: "※Combined shipping is not available for orders that include pre-order items."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1005:front.shopping.delivery_modal.combined.note5: "※If payment has already been received, we may not be able to accommodate your request."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1006:front.shopping.payment_modal.heading: Payment Information
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1007:front.shopping.payment_modal.deadline.title: Payment Deadline
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1008:front.shopping.payment_modal.deadline.body: "Payment is due by 15:00 (JST) on the 7th day after the order date.<br>If the due date falls on a holiday for financial institutions, the deadline will be 15:00 on the next business day.<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>Example: If ordered on April 1, the deadline is 15:00 on April 7.<br>(If April 7 is a Sunday, the deadline is 15:00 on April 8.)<br>-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-・-<br>※Orders past the payment deadline will be cancelled. If your payment will be delayed, please contact us in advance."
